// {"files":[{"path":"\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\danie\\OneDrive\\github-repos\\ai-chat-webui\\docs\\WORKSPACE.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":0,"newStart":1,"newLines":25,"lines":["+# Workspace implementation status","+","+The chat app is being restructured into a Workspace with user accounts on a","+self-hosted Supabase backend. This file tracks what each phase delivered.","+","+## Phase 1 — Self-hosted Supabase infrastructure and data model","+","+Delivered:","+","+- `supabase/docker-compose.yml`: Postgres, Supabase Auth, PostgREST, and a","+  Caddy gateway exposing them as one public Supabase URL.","+- `supabase/.env.example`: every stack secret and URL is documented. Real","+  secrets live only in the untracked `supabase/.env`.","+- `supabase/migrations/0001_workspace.sql`: `profiles`, `user_settings`,","+  `projects`, `conversations`, `messages`, `tasks`, and `memories` with","+  indexes, signup bootstrap, and row-level security. Anonymous users have no","+  table access; authenticated users can only touch their own rows.","+- `supabase/README.md`: start, migrate, health-check, backup/restore, and","+  production responsibilities.","+","+Still open after Phase 1:","+","+- No application code uses Supabase yet.","+- The existing single-user browser chat and unauthenticated `/api/generate`","+  behavior are unchanged."]}]}]}
